*Decided 2026-10-13: several coaches at sign-up is MVP (ADR-025 h). Design: signup-1-two-coaches.html,
signup-4-skaters-two-coaches.html, signup-5-waiting-two-coaches.html.*
  Step 1: each coach found is listed with a Remove button. Under the code box, "Add another coach" keeps the coach
    just found and clears the box for the next code. A code already on the list says so. Continue reads
    "Continue with <name>" for one coach, "Continue with N coaches" for more.
  Step 4: with more than one coach, each skater has "Which coaches?" checkboxes, all ticked to start; at least one
    is needed. The skater list shows each skater's coaches. The button reads "Send to your coaches".
  Step 5: each skater lists each coach they're waiting for. Booking with a coach opens once that coach approves.
  The adult skating themselves also picks which coaches.
